/// <summary>
/// How far an Emergency job's staff escalation has gone (AD-6, R18, R19). A separate field from the lifecycle
/// <see cref="JobStatus"/>: <c>None → NotifiedRachel → NotifiedBackup → Failed</c>, and <c>Acknowledged</c> once a
